       01 BS-ERROR-CATALOG REDEFINES BS-ERROR-CATALOG-DATA.
          05 BS-ERR-ENTRY OCCURS 500 TIMES INDEXED BY BS-ERR-IDX.
             10 BS-ERR-CODE       PIC 9(4).
             10 BS-ERR-SEVERITY   PIC X(1).
             10 BS-ERR-MNEMONIC   PIC X(30).
             10 BS-ERR-ISO-REASON PIC X(4).
             10 BS-ERR-DESC       PIC X(80).
             10 BS-ERR-ACTION     PIC X(81).

